  "content": "<p>我們有<a href=\"https://github.com/Commoble/morered/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/Commoble/morered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始碼</a>！</p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>在 More Red 1.21.1 版本中，已知與 Sodium 存在相容性問題，會導致纜線渲染異常。解決方法是改用 Embeddium 替代 Sodium：</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium</a> &nbsp;</p><p><strong>基於紅石的平板式邏輯閘方塊！</strong>&nbsp;<strong>可旋轉並安裝在牆面與天花板！</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8zGTn2H.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p><strong>放置前會預覽方塊定位！</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JJLT9yQ.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>萬物皆可連線！</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0lWnHPa.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>將電線與纜線鋪設於牆面與天花板！</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E86WYjE.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>",
